# Vendor/build binaries — purged from history 2026-08-08 (they were 1 GB of the
# repo's 559 MiB pack, which made every force-push crawl). Do not re-add:
#   pan-installer-*  are built by .github/workflows/release-installer.yml on each
#                    v*.*.* tag and published as GitHub release assets.
#   cloudflared.exe  self-downloads on first use (service/src/cloudflare-tunnel.js).
#   zrok2.exe        is not spawned by any code path.
service/bin/pan-installer-linux
service/bin/pan-installer-win.exe
service/bin/cloudflared.exe
service/bin/zrok2.exe

